Alert fires -> On call paged
On call paged -> Acknowledged, Escalate to lead
Escalate to lead -> Acknowledged
Acknowledged -> Customer impact
Customer impact -> Declare incident, Low priority ticket
Declare incident -> Open channel, Assign commander, Post status page
Assign commander -> Find cause
Open channel -> Find cause
Find cause -> Recent deploy, Dependency down, Capacity, Unknown
Recent deploy -> Roll back deploy
Dependency down -> Fail over
Capacity -> Scale up
Unknown -> Pull in experts
Pull in experts -> Find cause
Roll back deploy, Fail over, Scale up -> Verify recovery
Verify recovery -> Find cause, Resolve incident
Resolve incident -> Update status page, Write review
Post status page -> Update status page
Write review -> Action items
Low priority ticket -> Action items
